{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlJTIwQm9uZSUyMENvbGxlY3RvciUyMCUyODE5OTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Bone Collector","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7atMCqRaDpAOnGsteTRm17zmvN3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hMclNPye6G3ouN5QdusrlTK0SaE.jpg","description":"Lincoln Rhyme was the department's top homicide detective and leading expert in criminal forensics until an injury left him paralyzed, depressed, and incapable of working. But when a gruesome murder in Manhattan leaves detectives baffled, they call on Rhyme to help solve the mystery. Amelia Donaghy, a rookie cop whose quick thinking preserved a gruesome murder scene, is enlisted by Rhyme to be his on-the-scene forensics expert. With Amelia reluctantly acting as Rhyme's able-bodied go-between, the pair piece together cryptic clues the killer leaves behind at the scene of the crime, hoping to catch the grisly serial killer.","releaseInfo":"1999","genres":["Crime","Thriller","Mystery","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"118 min","cast":["Denzel Washington","Angelina Jolie","Queen Latifah","Michael Rooker","Michael McGlone","Luis Guzmán","Leland Orser","John Benjamin Hickey"],"director":["Phillip Noyce"],"released":"1999-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Right now, this serial killer could be looking at his next victim.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Denzel Washington","character":"Lincoln Rhyme","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jj2Gcobpopokal0YstuCQW0ldJ4.jpg"},{"name":"Angelina Jolie","character":"Amelia Donaghy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bXNxIKcJ5cNNW8QFrBPWcfTSu9x.jpg"},{"name":"Queen Latifah","character":"Thelma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zKJ0fZ7ne57fTWWd3WP1OVvoLS6.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Rooker","character":"Captain Howard Cheney","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ngOuHNIAGrKyY1O7F0f9C5Q9ONg.jpg"},{"name":"Michael McGlone","character":"Detective Kenny Solomon","